Aik program banayo jo 1 thi 5 tak numbers print karyo. Iske liye `for` loop use karyo:

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    // For loop example
    for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
        cout << i << " ";
    }
    return 0;
}
```

Output: `1 2 3 4 5`
